    "captionFormatted": "<a href=\"https://collections.tepapa.govt.nz/object/1391406\">Poster, \"We begin bombing in five minutes\"</a>, 1984, United States, by Artists Poster Committee. Gift of the Estate of Ron and Carmen Smith, 2015. Te Papa (GH024522)",
    "collection": "History",
